Use base::tryCatch() method, and write a simple error handler. See Jeroen's video <https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fB_7_RZgasg>, and you can also take a look at my demo app <https://github.com/aL3xa/univar-plot> to get some hints on how to catch errors and show them asynchronously.

aL3xa

